.*PURPOSE                                                        XM4256 00133402
.*                                                               XM4256 00135202
.*       THE PURPOSE OF THIS MACRO IS TO LOAD DEVICE SUPPORTED   XM4256 00137002
.*       ROCHESTER OWNED MODULES FROM THE DISTRIBUTION LIBRARY   XM4256 00138802
.*       ' SYS1.AOSD0 ' TO THE SYSTEM LIBRARY ' SYS1.LPALIB '    XM4256 00140602
.*       AT SYSGEN TIME.                                         XM4256 00142402
.*                                                               XM4256 00144202
.*                                                               XM4256 00146002
.*DISCRIPTION                                                    XM4256 00147802
.*                                                               XM4256 00149602
.*                                                               XM4256 00151402
.*       THIS MACRO WILL CHECK THE GLOBALS PASSED BY THE         XM4256 00153202
.*       GENERATE MACRO. EACH GLOBAL CORRESPONDS TO A DEVICE     XM4256 00155002
.*       BEING SYSGEN'D. THE GLOBALS AND CORRESPONDING           XM4256 00156802
.*       DEVICES ARE:                                            XM4256 00158602
.*                                                               XM4256 00160402
.*         GLOBAL      DEVICE      RELEASE DEVEPOLED             XM4256 00162202
.*                                                               XM4256 00164002
.*       &SGDCLSB(13)  2495         OS REL 19                    XM4256 00165802
.*       &SGDCLSB(58)  1287         OS REL 19                    XM4256 00167602
.*       &SGDCLSB(59)  1288         OS REL 19                    XM4256 00169402
.*       &SGDCLSB(78)  3505         OS REL 21                    XM4256 00171202
.*       &SGDCLSB(79)  3525         OS REL 21                    XM4256 00173002
.*       &SGDCLSB(86)  3890        VS1 REL 3                     XM4256 00174802
.*       &SGDCLSB(87)  3886        VS1 REL 3                     XM4256 00176602
.*                                                               XM4256 00178402
.*       IF THE GLOBAL WAS SET BY GENERATE FOR ANY DEVICE        XM4256 00180202
.*       IN THE MACRO; A CORRESPONDING 'COPY' AND 'SELECT'       XM4256 00182002
.*       STATEMENT IS CREATED BY USE OF THE PUNCH COMMAND.       XM4256 00183802
.*       THE MODULES SO SELECTED ARE LATER COPIED INTO           XM4256 00185602
.*       ' SYS1.LPALIB '                                         XM4256 00187402
.*                                                               XM4256 00189202
.*HISTORY                                                        XM4256 00191002
.*       THIS MACRO WAS CREATED AS A RESULT OF A SPLIT TO        XM4256 00192802
.*       SGIGG501 IN THE VS1 RELEASE 2 SYSTEM                    XM4256 00194602
.*                                                               XM4256 00196402
         COPY  SGGBLPAK                                                 00198202
         AIF   (NOT (&SGDCLSB(13) OR &SGDCLSB(58) OR &SGDCLSB(59))).NX1 00200003
         PUNCH ' COPY OUTDD=LPALIB,INDD=AOSD0 '                  Y02870 00250003
         PUNCH ' SELECT MEMBER=(IGG019VA,IGG019VB,IGG019VC,IGG019VD) '  00300003
